[TEXT] I have all the evidence I need. The smoking gun is confirmed: `advert_int 4` in the running keepalived.conf versus `advert_int 1` in the bundled sample on the same device, applied identically to all four VRRP instances on both dswa1 and dswa2.

**Evidence trail:**
- dswa1 `/etc/keepalived/keepalived.conf`: `advert_int 4` (all 4 VRRPs)
